<view class="page safe-bottom">
  <view class="title">每周复盘</view>
  <view class="subtitle">只看趋势，不被单日体重波动影响</view>

  <view class="section metric-grid">
    <view class="metric">
      <text class="metric-value">{{stats.averageWeight || "--"}}kg</text>
      <text class="metric-label">近14天均重</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric">
      <text class="metric-value">{{weightDeltaText}}</text>
      <text class="metric-label">近14天变化</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric">
      <text class="metric-value">{{stats.workoutDone}}</text>
      <text class="metric-label">力量次数</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric">
      <text class="metric-value">{{stats.cardioDone}}</text>
      <text class="metric-label">有氧次数</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section card trend-card">
    <view class="trend-head">
      <view class="section-title">体重 / 腰围趋势</view>
      <view class="trend-legend">
        <view class="legend-item"><text class="legend-dot weight"></text><text>体重</text></view>
        <view class="legend-item"><text class="legend-dot waist"></text><text>腰围</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <canvas canvas-id="trendChart" class="trend-chart"></canvas>
    <view class="subtitle">近14天记录越完整，趋势判断越稳定。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section card recommendation">
    <view class="section-title">调整建议</view>
    <view class="recommendation-text">{{stats.recommendation}}</view>
  </view>

  <button class="button-secondary section" bindtap="goHistory">历史记录</button>

  <view class="section card">
    <view class="section-title">复盘规则</view>
    <view class="subtitle">连续2周不降：少半拳主食，或多加一次30-40分钟坡度快走。下降过快且疲劳明显：加半拳主食，或减少一次有氧。</view>
  </view>
</view>
